# Fire-Field Ogre's unearth {U}{B}{R} (CR 702.84a): discarded to Faithless Looting (paid with a Mox Ruby) on turn 1, it can't
# be unearthed with Mox Pearl's {W}, Mox Jet's {B} and Mox Sapphire's {U} (no red); with the Jet tapped in the first main
# phase, its mana gone with the phase, nor in the second with the {W}, the {U} and a second Mox Ruby's {R} (no black); and on
# turn 3, the Sapphire tapped in the upkeep, nor with the {W}, the {B} and the two Rubies' {R}{R} (no blue): each colored pip
# is pinned. Then a second Mox Sapphire is cast, and it is unearthed, paid exactly with the Jet's {B}, a Ruby's {R} and the
# new Sapphire's {U}, leaving the pool empty. It has haste and attacks for 4, and is exiled at the beginning of the next end
# step.

